<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia police find marijuana on ship.</title>
<headline>Colombia police find marijuana on ship.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA, Colombia 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Police said they found 35 metric tons of marijuana on Thursday on a ship preparing to set sail for the Netherlands from Colombia's Caribbean port of Cartagena.</p>
<p>They said the drug had been packed into a shipping container and was surrounded by ground coffee. No arrests had been made, a police spokesman said.</p>
